# The modern spruce A on a probe (reports/content/2026-11-trees/fir/README.md, «Модель»): five spruces of 14 to
# 22 m on the meadow's forest edge west of the cart track east of the tavern, 5 to 8 m from the original's firs,
# built by scripts/content/fir_set.py probe; run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<that set>. Stills only, at noon, each in
# the calm after a gust:
#   row    38 m south of the edge and 4.4 m over spruce A's root: the five spruces and the original's firs behind;
#   far    30 m from spruce A (seed 7, 18 m), across the track, the eye 1.7 m over the ground;
#   near   9.5 m from its trunk, 5 m from its lower boughs;
#   close  6.5 m from the trunk, 2 m from the skirt, up into the lower tiers.
# The cameras stand by PROBE of the script: change both together.
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh fir-probe
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 12 0

# the hero stands aside of the first two views
goto pos 42750 3470 -2150
clear 3000
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 41300 3935 -3200 41000 4050 650
wait 5000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot row
wait 200

cam at 42600 3645 -2000 41250 4200 650
wait 2000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot far
wait 200

goto pos 41900 3305 -300
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 41770 3510 -150 41250 3700 650
wait 4000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot near
wait 200

cam at 41580 3513 90 41250 3760 650
wait 2000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot close
wait 200
